window.products.push({"id":351076,"name":"Ivarunner Funny Gnomes Bath Mat Diatomaceous Earth Mat, Happy Gnome Bathroom Rug for Bathroom Tub/Living Room Rug/Kitchen Mats/Home Decor, Wooden Back","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mpIZXLEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【High Quality】--- The front of this Diatomaceous Earth shower mat is made of high-quality diatom mud material, which is highly absorbent. The back is non-slip rubber, which is firm to hold, stable and non-slip.The corners are designed with a beautiful oval arc, which can protect your feet well. Note: Not a mouse pad, but the appearance and feel is very similar, and we have a special layer of water-absorbing sandwich in the middle of the mat, see the third picture ✅【Ultra Water Absorption & Quick Dry】--- Absorbent Stone Bath Mats are made of high-quality Diatomaceous material, strong water absorption. It can quickly absorb excess water, and the watermark will disappear quickly after use.Keeps the floor clean and dry without water accumulation ✅【Gnome Bath Rugs For Bathroom】--- Our Coffee Gnome Bath Mat 16 x 24 Inches, Printed With Colors And Crisp Lines Through Heat Dye Sublimation Technique. Tightly Wrapping At The Edge, The Bath Rugs Are Durable That Will Last For A Long-Time. Will Not Hurt The Floor. Our Bath Rugs Decor Your Home And Give Your Bathroom A New Look. ✅【Easy to Clean】--- The bathroom floor mat is different from the plush surface of the traditional plush bath mat, shower mat surface is smooth, so don’t worry about cleaning the hair and dust anymore.Simply wipe the bath room rug with a wet cloth, or rinse it with shower nozzle. Shake Off Outdoors, Simply Vacuum With A Hand-Held Vacuum, Rinse The Door Mat With A Hose And Dry The Door Mat.Please DO NOT place in the sun for a long time. ✅【Multifunctional Door Mats】--- Our Gnome diatomaceous mat is designed with unique patterns, which can complement any decoration style. Door mats are widely used as kitchen carpets and bathroom floor mats, suitable for bathrooms, kitchens, forlaundry room,corridors, balconies, bathtubs or sink","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mpIZXLEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivarunner","source_asin":"B0B719X2LX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B719X2LX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B719X2LX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
