window.products.push({"id":351214,"name":"Maison d' Hermine Den Bosch - Atmosphere 100% Cotton Table Runner Reusable for Party Dinner Holidays Kitchen Outdoor Home Wedding (14.50\"x72\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VK-SRC8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About the Product: A classic check pattern is given a contemporary twist on our Den Bosch table runner. Classic checked patterns with striking play of lines and squares all decked out in lovely seasonal colors feature on this table runner made from 100% cotton. Suitable for both formal and informal occasions, these checks lend style and sophistication to any table setting, making it much more welcoming to dine in. The Den Bosch table runner comes in a wide array of colors. Also available in a different size so you can find the right one for your table. About the Collection: Traditional checks make their annual holiday appearance by taking centre stage in our Den Bosch collection. Each piece is unique in its own way and features a lovely mix of patterns and hues carefully picked to add a whole new dimension to your space in terms of style and appeal. Perfect for the holiday season, each product in this collection is an example that a simple cheque pattern decorated in brilliant shades can still be powerful and bring some real character to your space. Made from 100% cotton, these products can be paired with different styles of checked patterns from our other collections. About the Brand: Maison d’ Hermine is a one-stop destination for people wanting a well-curated collection of charming and sophisticated table & kitchen linen. Designed to add an authentic European touch to your home, each collection is a work in art itself with intriguing details, artistic patterns, wonderful textures and rich colors. From modern themes to timeless classics each design is meticulously hand painted in water color and then expertly crafted down to the last detail on fabric with print. We pride ourselves on the stylish and practical choices we offer which are devoted to bring you products that inject color and character to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VK-SRC8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maison d' Hermine","source_asin":"B0BWJ3WRKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJ3WRKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJ3WRKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
