window.products.push({"id":351255,"name":"Mahogany Kitchen Towels with Five Assorted Designs, Set of 5, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mfGbFv2JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Set of 5 Red and White Kitchen Towels from Mahogany gives you a wonderful assortment of patterns and weaves for your kitchen. Each towel is 100-percent woven cotton, with a Red pattern woven into each white 28-Inch by 18-Inch towel. Each set contains one each herringbone weave center stripe, one center double-stripe, one 1-Inch windowpane check on a waffle weave towel, one wide check on a waffle weave towel, and finally one white check on a contrasting Red woven towel. Each towel has a sewn-in loop for easy hanging on a hook or rack, and all Mahogany kitchen towels are completely machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mfGbFv2JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mahogany","source_asin":"B003QXM2PO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003QXM2PO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003QXM2PO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351256,"name":"Zwilling J.A. Henckels Vintage 1877 45-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JRX5AmSAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A pattern with a distinctive history, Vintage 1877 was created by Zwilling J.A. Henckels to celebrate 275 years in business. The classic European design is an adaptation of a vintage pattern first introduced by the company circa 1877, and the clean, elegant style still makes an impressive statement at tables today. Crafted from heavy-gauge 18/10 stainless steel--18 percent chrome for corrosion resistance and 10 percent nickel for luster--this continentally sized flatware features contoured handles with narrow, winged necks and wide, softly rounded tips. Sculpted detailing on the ends adds a sophisticated touch of embellishment without looking cluttered or ostentatious. True to Henckel’s history as a fine knife maker, the dinner knife offers superior balance in the hand and has a forged blade for sharp, precise cuts. This 45-piece set provides service for eight plus five serving pieces. Each five-piece place setting includes a 7-inch salad fork, a 7-7/8 dinner fork, a 9-1/8-inch dinner knife, a 7-1/4-inch dinner spoon, and a 6-7/8-inch teaspoon. The service set includes an 8-1/4-inch serving spoon, an 8-1/2-inch meat fork, an 8-1/4-inch slotted serving spoon, a 6-7/8-inch butter knife, and a 5-7/8-inch sugar spoon. The set goes safely into the dishwasher for easy cleanup. What’s in the Box 8 place settings, 2 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: 7-inch salad fork; 7-7-/8-inch dinner fork; 9-1/8-inch dinner knife; 7-1/4-inch dinner spoon; 6-7/8-inch teaspoon. Service set consists of: 8-1/4-inch serving spoon; 8-1/2-inch meat fork; 8-1/4-inch slotted serving spoon; 6-7/8-inch butter knife; 5-7/8-inch sugar spoon. 45 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JRX5AmSAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B002LZUFH0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002LZUFH0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002LZUFH0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351257,"name":"RED GRAPES Roller Window Shades,100% Blackout UV Protection Roller Blinds,Window Blind with Thermal Insulated,Window Shade for Home Office Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j0+5d0aML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Product Dimension】Blind size: 31’’W x 72’’H, fabric size: 29.6’’W x 72’’H, color: Beige. *Noted:The fabric width is 1.4” narrower than the total blind width (Due to the brackets at the both ends). For inside mount, pls just select your window wide size.For outside mount, select shade width should be 4” + wider than your window width. 【New upgraded material】 -100% polyester fabric, 100% shading backing, with good air permeability. New upgraded flax texture shading roll curtain. Multicolor optional. Double thickened fabric layer and fine white coating process can help balance the temperature in the room. It has the characteristics of anti-static, dustproof and clean. Without special care, dirt and dust can be easily removed with a wet cloth or feather duster. 【Classic design and safety】 Equipped with metal chain and aluminum bottom rod. Bottom rod more fit fabric, windproof, good texture. To ensure the safety of your family, our rolling curtains are equipped with safety devices to attach chains to the wall and we provide you with all relevant safety devices and instructions on how to use them. 【 100% BLACKOUT 】Transform any room into a haven of darkness and tranquility with our blackout roller shade. Whether you're trying to sleep, watch a movie, or just relax in peace, this shade has you covered. Its high-quality fabric blocks out virtually all light and noise, making it the perfect choice for light-sensitive individuals or anyone who wants total darkness. Install it easily and enjoy the benefits of a darker, more peaceful environment. 【100% quality guarantee】 - Factory direct sales. Our textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. We have confidence in the quality of our products. If you have any problems with RED GRAPES rolling curtains, please do not hesitate to contact us. We provide perfect after-sale guarantee service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j0+5d0aML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RED GRAPES","source_asin":"B09L8JL6D8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L8JL6D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L8JL6D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351258,"name":"oudwoodvietnam.com - Agarwood Chips Oud Chips Incense Aroma | Cultivated Agarwood Chips from Oudwood Vietnam | Pure Material Grade A++ | 100 Grams","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81apg2dgKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL - High Quality Oud Chips, Agarwood Chips, harvested from the tropical forest of Quang Nam - Hoi An the middle area of Viet Nam by Oudwood Vietnam brand. Natural and rare, high quality with lots of agarwood oil inside. Great scent in all kinds of incense oud agarwood in the world. The Vietnam Agarwood is always considered the highest quality natural Agarwood because of the special aroma. HOW TO USE - Oud chips Agarwood Chips: Oud Agarwood are used very commonly as Home Fragrance Products - Incense of many religions. You can cut or grind our agarwood chips incense for easy burning on coal or electric incense burner. HELPFULNESS IN SPIRITUAL ACTIVISM - Oud wood - Agarwood is considered \"wood of the Gods.\" Natural agarwood has gentle and delicate aroma. Since ancient times, agarwood oud incence powder has been used in rituals of many different religions. And agarwood aloeswood chips are often used as fragrance incense. The natural agawood is also used to make meditation, yoga into the realm of relaxation. In some cultures, it is believed that agarwood disperse negative energy. LONG LASTING SCENT - these oud agarwood chips incense guarantees you long lasting aroma that takes you into another space. You can still smell the fragrance after many hours of burning. VIETNAM HIGH QUALITY AGARWOOD CHIPS - Agarwood is found in natural forests in some Southeast Asian countries such as Malaysia, Indonesia, Thailand, India, Vietnam, ... Vietnam Agarwood is considered as the highest quality agarwood. Vietnam agarwood scent is different from the other types of aquilaria, it is often considered as a precious material for agarwood incense because of this special aroma. We assure you that we always provide agarwood chips products harvested from tropical fores","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81apg2dgKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"oudwoodvietnam.com","source_asin":"B07GMV5W9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GMV5W9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GMV5W9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351259,"name":"Artdix Roman Shades Blinds Window Shades - Stripe 34.5 W x 84L Inches (1 Piece) Linen Sheer Solid Fabric Custom Made Roman Shades for Windows, Doors, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61apSvQIJqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to measure Inside mount Window Width: To find the width, measure the top, middle and bottom within your window recess. Use the narrowest width as your window width. Window Length: To find the length, measure exact window-recess length at left, middle and right side. Use the longest height as the window length. Window Depth: Minimum 2 inches required. Ordering: Choose a width that is 1/4 inch smaller than the widow width from above. Choose a length that is same or longer than your window length. Outside mount Determine where the roman shade is to be placed. You will need a minimum 7/8 inches of flat mounting space above your window to accommodate the mounting hardware. Width: Choose a roman blind width that is same or greater than the window width. We recommend add 3-6 inches extra to the measured width to maximize light control and privacy. Length: Measure exact measured-length from the top of the proposed headrail location to the base of sill. If there is no sill, measure where you would like the window roman blind to drop. Add 8-10 inches to the length for optimum light control and privacy. Ordering: Choose a width that is same or wider than the product width from above.  Choose a length that is same or longer than your measured length. How to Get a Custom Roman Shade 1. Get the mount type (inside or outside mount) according to your window type 2. Get the roman shade size according to above measurement method 3. Email us the following information 3.1 Product you like (you can send us LINK or ASIN)  3.2 Mount type 3.3 Roman shade size 4. We give you the price and order link 5. Receive the roman shade, if have any problem, please send message to us or call us, we can solve any problem together with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61apSvQIJqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artdix","source_asin":"B07TCLD2MJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TCLD2MJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TCLD2MJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
