window.products.push({"id":351340,"name":"Thick 60x38 Inch Clear Plastic Table Protector PVC Tabletop Cover Mat Rectangular Plastic Table Cover Desk Pad Mat Office Computer Desk Side Table Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fB3i14kUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1. MATERIAL & PRACTICAL- Eco-friendly PVC material with the characteristics of Waterproof, Protect your table, desk, tablecloth and furniture tops against scratches, scuffs, stains, spillage etc. Great for dining table, wooden table, glass, marble, stainless steel top, office desk, writing desktops, coffee & end table, TV bench, dresser and chest table, night stand, countertop, hard floor etc. 2. THICK & HEAVY DUTY - Our thickness clear table cloth cover is heavy enough to stay in place.The clear table mat is recommended for kitchen and dining room table which has better heat resistant, maximum to 176°F/80°C. The clear pad is the best choice for textured table tops or on top of a tablecloth. For glass, marble or other smooth finishes, please use a tablecloth to prevent air bubbles. 3. CUT TO FIT - Our clear table cover is perfect for your kitchen, dining room table, furniture desktop, tablecloth, coffee table, office desk, writing desktops etc. They come with many different sizes and are able to cut to size. A sharp scissors, a pencil and a ruler is needed to make a perfect cut. Once you have these tools, you can customize your own rectangle tablecloth, square tablecloth or contact us for a custom cut size. 4. EASY TO CLEAN - Our waterproof clear table pad is transparent and very easy to clean. Simply wiping this vinyl table cover with a damp cloth that can get all the mess off its surface and you may be ready instantly to serve next round of guests! These plastic table covers can be used not only as rectangular tablecloth but also as desk protector or clear desk pad. 5. DURABLE- This PVC Vinyl cover is often used to enhance the appearance of a dining room and dampen the sounds of clinking flatware and scraping dinnerware. It is also a popular choice for catered events, banquets, and outdoor dining areas. The most important point is that it is very durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fB3i14kUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPLENDEFUL","source_asin":"B08TLWY1VR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TLWY1VR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TLWY1VR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
