window.products.push({"id":351469,"name":"Bath Towels White Set of 6 Cotton Bathroom Towels | Small Bath Towels for Bathroom 22 x 46 Inch | Ultra Soft Absorbent Spa Towels | Ring Spun Bath Tow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xRLyxinvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AbsorbencyThe number of loops, the length of the loops, the thickness of threads, the type of cotton, and how strongly the fibres are packed together all affect the absorbency of a towel. Greater GSM and heavyweight towels are more absorbent than lightweight towels. Typically a GSM over 450 is a good indication of the quality and absorbent towel, but of course, they need longer to dry. SoftnessSoftness in towels is a requirement or necessities everyone is looking for in Towels after stepping out of a bath, which means the dye is infused into the yarns under high pressure and high temperature for 6-12 hours depending upon the colour that results in a soft, plush, lavish, sophisticated and luxurious look product. Feel the softness of our luxury towels while drying off your hands, face and body. DurabilityThese high-end Bathroom Towels are all Vat Dyed, which is quite popular in the market due to their great quality, and usefulness. The Vat Dyed technique produces more durable and sturdy towels that will last for many years. The stitching and finishing of high-quality towels are given special attention. So, consider the layers and stitches. We assure you that all of our towels are double-stitched along the lengths and layers to withstand several washes while adhering to the care instructions. Effortless and Easy Care Machine wash cold. Tumble dry on low heat. Wash with like colours. Avoid fabric softener. Do not use bleach. Wash before first use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xRLyxinvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nouveau Collection","source_asin":"B0BB87B9ZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB87B9ZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB87B9ZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
