window.products.push({"id":351489,"name":"STEZHOU 8 Pcs Rug Gripper for Hardwood Floors, Non Slip Washable Gripper for Rug, for Area Rugs, Grip Rug Corners to Prevent Sliding Vacuum Tech, Mate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bgUDm+q1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Vacuum Technology: Anti slip rug pad grips for hardwood floor use Vacuum Tech design, which can grip to your hard floor firmly. It’s totally harmless to your floor, not like some other glue tape. It can be easily peeled off from the floor and it’s resuable. Suction technology firmly sticks to the floor without causing marks or damage. Multiple usages: The rug stickers for wood floor not only prevent your rug from bunching or sliding in daily use like traditional rug pad, but also make the rug corner anti curling. The 4 rug corner grippers will make your whole rug in place. Especially it’s useful for area rug , runner, pet rug or smaller rug etc. Design Feature: This rug corner grippers can easily be glued under most rug. The side facing the floor features tiny suction pores. These pores utilize the VACUUM TECH feature in which whenever pressure is applied from the top, air escapes and creates a low-pressure region within the cups. This produces an adhesive effect, which keeps your rug in place. Advantages: Inconspicuous padding under your carpet, only 2 mm thickness and inconspicuous after installing, This no skid stopper works on all mat and all hard floors, like wood floor, laminate floor etc, The tape for rug adds extra comfort underfoot owing to the slightly bouncy nature of suction technology. Components: This package includes 8 pieces, The square carpet tape can be applied to the corners and the long strip can be applied to the middle of the carpet in order to increase the surface area in contact with the floor. This makes your kitchen, bathroom and hallway safer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bgUDm+q1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STEZHOU","source_asin":"B0BKPDZGXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKPDZGXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKPDZGXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
