window.products.push({"id":351528,"name":"Magic Drapes 800 Thread Count 1 Piece Fitted Sheet 100% Long Staple Cotton with Sateen Weave Premium Quality Lightweight Sheets Ultra Soft Bedding wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zPVd1wP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"800 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton ETHICALLY SOURCED AND HAND STITCHED - Our Sheets are made ethically, using environmentally friendly materials and processes. Each product is created in a certified, socially compliant, and awarded factory that supports many working families. AUTHENTICATED 800 THREAD COUNT COTTON SHEETS made from fine yarn are lighter and smoother than other 800 thread count sheets. They are a perfect blend of Thickness and Softness. EASY CARE AND MAINTENANCE – Made from Fade Resistant Dyes, the best quality sheets stay bright even after extended use. These sheets get softer with each wash. Machine wash cold on gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Wash sheets separately to reduce wrinkling. LUXURY PERSONIFIED- These one of a kind sheet sets are made from thick and breathable fabric which only a high thread count sheet crafted from the finest 100% Egyptian cotton can provide. These sheets are made keeping your comfort in mind so they are carefully woven with exquisite craftsmanship. PERFECT FITTING- Deep Pocket Fitted Sheets with specially patented stitching pattern using high quality all around elastic. They fit mattresses upto 16\" . Queen Size Fully Elasticized Fitted sheet with deep pockets: 60” x 80” + 16\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zPVd1wP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Drapes","source_asin":"B0BHHD9Z7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHHD9Z7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHHD9Z7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351529,"name":"Intellibed Gel Adjustable Foam Pillow, Standard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNZq4U-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The intellipillow is not your average pillow. In addition to having the most advanced cushioning material, intelli-gel, it is also built with an adjustable air chamber, allowing the pillow to meet the needs of many different body types simply and easily. With proper inflation, the air chamber creates proper spinal alignment by filling the void between your neck, shoulders and the surface of your mattress. It may take a few nights to get the air chamber properly inflated, so Please be patient if the pillow doesn't feel right the first night. To start tuning your pillow, begin with no air at all. If this doesn't work for you after the first night, begin tuning your pillow by inflating the air chamber with between 10-15 pumps. To access the air chamber, unzip the side of the pillow cover and look for the piece with the Dark pad inside. Place a finger over the small hole and squeeze the pad. Release your finger from the hole to allow more air to enter. If you have inflated the air chamber too much, use your Pinky or a pencil to push the silver button next to the square inflation pad to release air from the chamber. This silver button releases the air slowly. It has been manufactured to be a little difficult to Press so you cannot roll over and, unknowingly, release the air from the chamber while you are asleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNZq4U-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nakital","source_asin":"B01E3P3DJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E3P3DJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E3P3DJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
