window.products.push({"id":351672,"name":"MERCIER KITCHEN Manual Knife Sharpener Set, Professional 2 Stage Tungsten Steel and Ceramic Sharpening Rods System","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k-3EaKwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MERCIER KITCHEN introduces 2 stage knife sharpener. Every professional chef knows that a sharp knife is the most essential tool in the kitchen. But even the best knife is useless if it's not sharp. Keeping your knives in good working order can be tedious, though! Are you ready to bring your dull blades into brand-new condition? Use Mercier knife sharpener and you can transform any blunt kitchen knife into a razor sharp cutting tool! Takes the guesswork out of honing your favorite knives, with its perfectly angled rods. Mercier sharpener is a work horse in the kitchen. Easily sharpen your favorite knife in the comfort of your own home. You don't have to worry about the type of material used on your knives because this sharpener can sharpen even the hardened steel knives. This knife sharpener makes your cutting tasks easy. Whether you are dicing vegetables, slicing meet, or carving the Sunday roast, a sharp knife can really help. Use its 2 stage sharpening to sharpen and polish your knives. The sharpener only removes microscopic amounts of knife metal. You do not need to worry about damaging your valuable knives. This sharpener is designed to safeguard your knives and keep them sharp. Do not wait! End the knives dullness! Instructions: 1. Place the knife sharpener on a flat surface. 2. Hold the knife sharpener by the handle. 3. Pull the knife along the coarse slot a few times. 4. Pull it down the fine slot a couple times to polish the blade off and to hone the knife. User tips: 1. Pull inwards from the outside while sharpening; never go back and forth. 2. Keep the sharpener dry and clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k-3EaKwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mercier Kitchen","source_asin":"B01MG3K7UY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MG3K7UY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MG3K7UY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351673,"name":"SUPERIOR Modal from Beechwood 300-Thread Count Solid Duvet Cover and Pillow Shams, Full/Queen, Ivory, 3-Piece SetxSuperior","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MME6aODdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AFFORDABLE LUXURY LINENS. Experience the best in affordable luxury with these 100% Modal from Beechwood Duvet Cover Sets. These duvet covers are soft, comfortable, perfect for everyday use, and sure to bring a little bit of paradise to your home. Modal is just as soft, warm, and breathable as cotton, and is less likely to shrink and pill after washing. 300 Thread Count Modal is strong, durable, bright in color, and if cared for properly, will be long lasting. HERITAGE. We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MME6aODdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B01BFBST6E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BFBST6E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BFBST6E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351674,"name":"IRIS USA Cordless Cyclone Vacuum Cleaner w/ Motorized Brush Head, 2-in-1 Attachment, 60 RPM Self Standing Suction Stick with Rechargeable Battery, Har","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174J-3gwcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The IRIS USA Cordless Vacuum has a wide cleaning path to pick up crumbs, dust, pet hair, dander, and other debris. The 2-stage Centrifugal Separation System uses advanced cyclone suction to divide small and large particles, while maintaining suction power at 99%+. The power head brush roller (P model only) spins at up to 60,000 RPM for powerful cordless cleaning performance. The rechargeable battery runs ~35 min on Low or ~15 min on High on a full charge, with full suction power the whole time. The easy-to-read indicator on the control panel shows you how much battery is left, so you know how much clean time you have left. A full recharge of the battery takes ~4 hours.For most types of flooring (hardwood, tile, low rugs). The IRIS USA Cordless Vacuum lays down flat and can flex up to 90 degrees for impressive reach. Swivel steering allows you to clean under beds and furniture with ease. Remove the middle extender tube for more versatility or attach the included crevice tool to make it even easier to clean stairs, upholstery, cars, RVs, boats, and more. The double filtration system uses both a sponge filter and an exhaust filter to catch fine dust particles and help keep the exhausted air clean. When you’re done cleaning, you can empty the dust cup easily with the press of a button. This durable dust cup is 100% washable, and saves you money over expensive vacuum bags. The rechargeable battery and filters are easy to install and remove, so you can replace them whenever you see fit. The N1 model comes with a lightweight 11.3” cleaning head. The P1 and P6 models sport a heavy duty power head with motorized brush roller. The P6 model also comes with an additional assortment of useful accessories: Mini Brush Nozzle, Stand, Multiangle Brush, Pet Hair Brush, and Adjuster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174J-3gwcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IRIS USA, Inc.","source_asin":"B0BMT8NLL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMT8NLL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMT8NLL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
