window.products.push({"id":351817,"name":"Majestic Giftware Metal Aluminium Menorah Tree Design with Nickel Plated Finish-7\" H #MN11758","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Yan4oEH2L._AC_.jpg","description":"This beautiful and elegant metal Chanukah candle menorah will help you celebrate the festival of lights in style. Hanukkah is a Jewish holiday commemorating the rededication of the Holy Temple (the second Temple) in Jerusalem at the time of the Maccabean revolt against the Seleucid Empire. Hanukkah is observed for eight nights and days, starting on the 25th day of isle according to the Hebrew calendar, which may occur at any time from late November to late December in the Gregorian calendar. It is also known as the festival of lights and the feast of dedication. The festival is observed by the kindling of the lights of a unique candelabrum, the nine-branched menorah (also called a Chanukah/Hanukah), one additional light on each night of the holiday, progressing to eight on the final night. The typical menorah consists of eight branches with an additional visually distinct branch. The extra light, with which the others are lit, is called a Shamash (Hebrew: שמש‎‎, \"attendant\") and is given a distinct location, usually above or below the rest.[1] other Hanukkah festivities include playing deride and eating oil-based foods such as doughnuts and latkes. Since the 1970s, the worldwide Chabad Hasidic movement has initiated public menorah Lightings in open public places in many countries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Yan4oEH2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Majestic Giftware","source_asin":"B01MSJC1G1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSJC1G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSJC1G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351818,"name":"STARCEBS Gray Blackout Curtains & Drapes 70 x 63 inches Long/Length 2 Panels Set for Living Room/Bedroom Diamond Curtain Thermal Insulated Curtains Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y55WPoEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100%polyester ☪PACKAGE INCLUDES - Light blocking curtain sold as 2 panels/set. Each curtain panel measures 70\" wide by 63\" long. The design of grommet makes the curtain easy to install and slide. 2 panels has 10 metal grommets on top. 1.6 inches' inner diameter comparable with most rods. ☪DIAMOND PATTERN & SOLID HEAVY FABRIC - Making by high quality 100% polyester fabric, our grommet curtains are super smooth, soft and free from chemical smell. Each blockout curtain panel has a diamond pattern design which makes your space unique. Our soundproof curtain has 3-layer sound insulation which can reduce the noise from outside to provide you a better environment to work or sleep. ☪ROOM DARKENING CURTAINS - The bedroom curtains compare to normal curtains has two black layers which can block out 90%-95% sunlight and UV ray ( Darker colors work better) to keep room darkening, 3-layer sound insulation to keep space quiet, perfect for late/afternoon sleepers and protect your personal privacy from being exposed . ☪THERMAL INSULATED CURTAINS - Our window curtains panels can prevent energy losing by insulating summer heat and winter chill. Protect floor and upholstery from color shading by sun. Perfect thermal curtains for bedroom, living room, kids room, dining room, nursery room and so on. ☪EASY TO CARE: The blackout curtain is simple to care. Machine washable in gentle cycle and cold water(≤86°F),do not dry cleaning. Do not bleach or tumble dry, iron at low temperature settings. Decoration will make the space more artistic. Hope you can findout your favorite curtains in STARCEBS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y55WPoEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STARCEBS","source_asin":"B0995VW1NK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995VW1NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995VW1NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
