window.products.push({"id":351829,"name":"Thinp High Accuracy Modern Mechanical Dial Scale with Transparent Tempered Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+tKKCu5UL._AC_SL1402_.jpg","description":"Hello , welcome to “Thinp”. Thinp High Accuracy Modern Mechanical Dial Scale is a new fashion of your life. The transparent tempered glass shows the quality of the scale. The conbination of glass and metal is perfect that makes it a good choice of the senior hotel. Thinp High Accuracy Modern Mechanical Dial Scale is more accurate than the digital scales cause the mechanical principles. No matter how advanced the digital scales are, sometimes , they may turn to something wrong. Thinp High Accuracy Modern Mechanical Dial Scale needs no batteries, which can save more energy. Also it can increase the life expectancy. No switch to turn on or turn off. Simple and easy. More Operation Instructions Can Found In The User Manual If you have other questions, you can contact us via phone or email anytime for support Finally, hope you have a good day","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+tKKCu5UL._AC_SL1402_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thinp","source_asin":"B01534EED6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01534EED6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01534EED6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351830,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 3.5” x 5” Super Thick [23MM Thickness] Clear Acrylic Magnetic Block Picture Frame, Double-Sided, Frameless, Freestanding, Floating Photos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DRytV-HZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs Super Thick Double-Sided Block Clear Acrylic Picture Frame rests in sturdy fashion on any countertop. You may find it hard to walk past this see-through two-sided “frameless” frame and not stop and gaze at the beauty displayed on both sides. With its crystal-clear appearance and modern magnetic design, you can easily display two photos at the same time. The two-sided frame makes a wonderful display frame for retail store, coffeeshop, hotel and restaurant counterspace. This transparent, freestanding frame is a wonderful choice for baby and bridal showers, and it makes a beautiful wedding centerpiece frame. The frame’s simple, see-through design draws attention to the beauty in the photos. Tell a story of love with matching photos or showcase the everyday moments in life that bring you joy. Look back on a ski trip, or pair a photo from a family barbecue with one at a winery. Capture your child laughing and your dog playing. The sturdy and professional quality to this extra thick, clear block frame adds a nice touch to the décor of any room. You will enjoy how easy it is to remove and replace photos when you slide apart the acrylic panes. Strong magnets in the four corners of the frame keep your photo firmly secured. Displaying graduation photos with cute first day of school shots, takes no effort. Relive college reunions and put your photography skills on display. Preserve your parents’ old thin mementos or switch them out for snapshots that tell the story of your own travels. This modern frame may become your favorite gift choice as it is ideal for any occasion or season. This durable frame is available in multiple sizes and great multi-pack offers. It can easily be wiped clean with a damp cloth or paper towel. We spend so much time flipping through images on screens all day, it feels good to see our memories and passions properly on display. [NOTES: (1) DO NOT USE GLASS CLEANER ON ACRYLIC. (2) THIS FRAME CAN NOT BE MOUNTED ON A WALL]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DRytV-HZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B0136OPM40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0136OPM40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0136OPM40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
