window.products.push({"id":351977,"name":"Rachael Ray Create Delicious Deep Hard Anodized Nonstick Frying Pan / Fry Pan / Hard Anodized Skillet - 10.25 Inch, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T8tNAvWJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Radiant and solution-oriented, the Rachael Ray Create Delicious Hard Anodized Aluminum 10.25-Inch Nonstick Covered Deep Frying Pan brings high-quality performance and everyday convenience to home chefs eager for kitchen versatility with style. Featuring contemporary design combined with value-driven functionality, this versatile covered deep frying pan is ideal for one-pan meals like Rach's Orange-Glazed Pork Chops or her creamy Carbonara with Saffron & Shrimp. The skillet's durable hard-anodized aluminum construction is twice as hard as stainless steel, provides ultra-even heating, and features enhanced PlatinumShield™ Technology black nonstick reinforced to be 9 times harder than titanium for effortless food release and easy cleanup. Want more? Colorful, double-riveted stainless steel and silicone fry pan handles provide comfort and control that’s oven safe to 400°F, and a shatter resistant glass lid locks in heat and flavor while allowing foods to be monitored while they cook. Flared cookware rims make for easy pouring, and an induction-suitable stainless steel base provides strength, durability, and versatility to use the frying pan on any stovetop. From easy-clean convenience to the enhanced durability of PlatinumShield™ nonstick, go deep and reach for the big-time brilliance of the Rachael Ray Hard Anodized Aluminum 10.25-Inch Nonstick Covered Deep Frying Pan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T8tNAvWJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B07Z7HK3P3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z7HK3P3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z7HK3P3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351978,"name":"VEVOR Fruit Wine Press, 0.8Gal Wine Press, 3L Fruit Cider Grinder w/ Dual Stainless Steel Barrels, Manual Press Machine with Triangular Structure & T-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jbiNFyvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food-Grade SUS Barrels: Our fruit wine press features two barrels. Inner: 2.5 L (0.7 Gal) in capacity and inner and Φ5.5\"x4.9\" (Φ140x125 mm) in size. Outer: 3 L (0.8 Gal) in capacity and Φ7.1\"x4.5\" (Φ180x115 mm) in size. The juice will flow through the meshes on the inner barrel and the outlet on the outer. To obtain a higher juice yield and reduce waste, please cut the ingredients into small pieces before pressing. A nylon filter bag is offered to hold the ingredients and avoid splashing. Stable Triangular Structure: The triangular structure is designed for an eye-pleasing appearance and sturdy support. With the reinforced base and three upright aluminum posts, the stability of our wine press can be ensured. It will keep still during operation and is hard to knock over. Both of the barrels are made of food-grade stainless steel, hygienic and durable, providing you with the original flavor of the juice or wine. You can receive an ideal effect for separating the dregs and liquid. Effortlessly Press & Juice: The T-shaped handle is integrated into our fruit cider press for effortless operation. Just rotate the handle, then you can enjoy a cup of hand-made juice or wine in your spare time and feel the slow pace of life. The stainless press plate also perfectly fits the opening of the inner barrel—larger contact area, higher juice yield. Easily Take Apart & Clean: Unlike the electric juicers, our fruit press for wine-making calls attention to easy washing. All the parts of this fruit press are detachable, from the comfort of which you can put them into the water for thorough cleaning. Versatile Manual Presser: Apart from making home wine, our manual wine presser enjoys wide-range usage and multi-functionality. You can apply it to fruits, vegetables, cheese, honey, herbs, etc. Olive oil extraction can also be achieved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jbiNFyvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B09SC1TSRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SC1TSRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SC1TSRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
