window.products.push({"id":351991,"name":"Tbcoou Gray Blackout Curtains Silver Wave Foil Print Star Curtain Thermal Insulated Room Darkening Grommet Light Blocking Window Drapes for Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KZvfvUDmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Grommet Top Thermal Curtains ]: Package includes 2 blackout curtain panels, each measures 52\"W (100\"W for pair), our thermal curtains feature 8 silver grommets of 1.6 inch inner diameter coordinate with most window curtain rods. We recommend the total width of curtain panels being 1.5-2 times the curtain rod length. [ Foil Print Star Curtains ]: Silver wave line with star foiled on the window curtains reflect and bounce the light as glowing. The subtle metallic design give it an elegant and modern feel which looks amazing in the light. Our curtains for living room are available in various colors and sizes which can easily fit in with your existing home decor. [ Blackout Curtains for Bedroom ]: Tbcoou blackout drapes can effectively block out 80% of the sunlight and UV rays, due to the triple weave technology. This blackout fabric balances room temperature by insulating all seasons, super soft Blackout Curtain Panels are very upmarket. Besides, thermal insulated, soundproof, fade-resistant, energy efficient, both sides are the same color. [ Wide Compatibility Panels ]: These silver grommet top curtains will certainly spark your home décor immediately, perfect for living room, bedroom, laundry room, dining room, kitchen, bathroom, kids room, nursery, french door, sliding door, doorway, basement, closet. [ Easy Care Insulated Curtains ]: These room darkening curtain sets are made to last. The curtain panels are durable on the window thanks to the sturdy triple weave design and top-notch sewing quality. Black out curtains are machine washable in cold water and tumble dry in low setting. Do not bleach. Creases on the curtain from packing and shipping can be pressed by ironing or steaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KZvfvUDmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tbcoou","source_asin":"B09L8B3TN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L8B3TN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L8B3TN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":351992,"name":"NOVICA Brown Prayer Suar Wood Sculpture, 7.75\" Tall 'Cat Gives Thanks'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LpRvfhk0L._AC_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: With paws clasped in a fervent wish, this charming cat closes its eyes in a prayer of thanks. Nengah Sudarsana expresses his love for animals through his wood sculptures, masterfully carved by hand. - Signed by the artist - Each artwork is unique -- wood grain, color, and pattern will differ slightly from picture About our Artist: 'From an early age I loved natural things: plants, animals, birds or sea life. When I was still quite young I knew I had an ability to translate nature into artful things of beauty. Although I have no formal art training and work purely from my own inspiration and intuition, I know what looks good and what doesn't look right in a carving. I particularly want to create wildlife and other animal themes in an exact, realistic and original way.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LpRvfhk0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00817HQNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00817HQNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00817HQNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
