window.products.push({"id":351994,"name":"LUFT Cube Portable Air Purifier for Car, Home, Office, Bedroom, Desk - Compact Air Cleaner Removes Pollen, Dust, and Dander with Air Vent Cap & Car Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IeUAsQzML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅WASHABLE FILTER DESIGN - No extra maintenance and filter replacement are required saving you unnecessary cost. LUFT Cube removes Volatile Organic Vapors which the human body cannot break down. Our SPP purifier outperforms HEPA air purifiers on the market. All you need to do is rinse and wash the metal mesh every 2 weeks saving you the cost of filters. ✅NEW GENERATION OF TECHNOLOGY - Our SPP (Semiconductor-light Photocatalytic Purification) tech is an evolution from the old PCO (Photocatalytic Oxidation) and is a powerful air purification technology to remove dust, dander, pollen, etc. ✅PLUG & PLAY - Our air purifiers are a great batteryless solution for a better environment. Easy to use, just plug it into a power source or use a power bank to run the air cleaner. You have the option to use the included air vent cap to control the direction of clean air. ✅ENERGY EFFICIENT & COST EFFECTIVE - Powered by USB type-C, the air purifier is energy efficient and costs less than $2/year to run. The air cleaner is quiet (below 30dB) and will last for 40,000 hours (4.5 years). ✅PORTABLE & SUITABLE FOR TRAVELLING - The perfect size to fit into your bag allowing you to take it everywhere. The LUFT Cube is stylish and perfect for use at your home, desk, car, office, bedroom, bathroom, or anywhere that requires improvement in the air quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IeUAsQzML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUFTQI","source_asin":"B08D9KTXZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-351994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D9KTXZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D9KTXZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
